<title>USA: PHLX to trade options on Longhorn Steaks.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade options on Longhorn Steaks.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said it will begin trading put and call options on Longhorn Steaks Inc. on October 15.</p>
<p>The options will trade on the February expiration cycle with initial expirations in November, December, February and May. Opening strikes will be 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago Derivatives Desk</p>
<p>312-408-8750; E-mail derivatives@reuter.com</p>
